#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I start a new game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; loads directly into the game mode. You can start playing right "
"away."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I start a new round?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:239
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To start a new game round you can use a <link linkend=\"menu-game-new"
"\">menubar option</link>, or a <link linkend=\"menu-game-new\">keyboard "
"shortcut</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:242
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I pause the game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kappname; does not have a 'Pause' feature, as none is required."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Currently you can only change the player's colors, but not the game theme. "
"To change the player's colors use the <link linkend=\"configuration\">'Game "
"Configuration'</link> dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have made a mistake. Can I undo?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:251
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To undo your last move you can use a <link linkend=\"move-menu-undo"
"\">menubar option</link>, or a <link linkend=\"move-menu-undo\">keyboard "
"shortcut</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use keyboard?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &kappname; can not be played using the keyboard."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid "I can't figure out what to do here! Are there hints?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:259
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To see a hint you can use a <link linkend=\"move-menu-hint\">menubar "
"option</link>, or a <link linkend=\"move-menu-hint\">keyboard shortcut</"
"link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:262
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I'm not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To save your progress use a <link linkend=\"menu-game-save\">'Save' "
"option</link> on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:266
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I restore the game I saved?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:267
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To load your progress from a saved game use a <link linkend=\"menu-game-"
"load\">'Load' option</link> on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:270
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where are the highscores?"
